  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3paFjuRfz9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wYCbA6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"111\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3XOjTB1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"167\" height=\"111\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ceNJD8V.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"167\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nrj9TOe.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"155\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frawgit.com%252fAllTheMods%252fATM3-Lite%252fmaster%252fmodlist.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;完整模組列表</a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedstorage.raoulvdberge.com%252fpackcomparer.php%253fa%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fatm-3-lite%252ffiles%252f2658329%2526b%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fall-the-mods-3%252ffiles%252f2639207\" rel=\"nofollow\">與 ATM 3 的比較</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>關於此整合包<br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>隨著每日不斷有新模組加入 ATM3 整合包，我們很榮幸地</p>\n<p>宣布輕量版！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如同為 1.10.2 版本打造的 ATM: Lite 整合包一樣，本整合包旨在成為 ATM3 的輕量版本。其設計不僅對系統資源友善，更為許多玩家認為模組過多而失衡的整合包增添了相當程度的平衡性。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請放心，持續的研發與玩家社群的反饋將塑造並精進此整合包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>初始版本僅需 4GB 記憶體即可運行。請在您的配置檔案選項中，將記憶體設定調整至至少 4096MB。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>敬請期待後續更新！</p>",
